{"articleNo":"366585","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=366585&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [국민대학교] 제5회 국민대학교 자율주행 경진대회 참가 홍보 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.05.11","hit":"11446","attachments":[{"name":"붙임. 제5회 국민대학교 자율주행 경진대회 포스터 1부.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=366585&attachNo=112185"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">대 회 명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">회 국민대학교 자율주행 경진대회</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">참가대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">전국 대학 학부생으로 구성된 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">명 이내의 팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">졸업생 및 대학원생 지원 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">접수기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2022.05.16.(</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) 18</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">시까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fa